  "scope": [
    "Typed root[path] reads, writes, compound assignments and prefix/postfix increments with converted assignment results and ordinary property update semantics",
    "Independent source-ordered root/key/value snapshots, frozen path selection, ARC/MRC full-expression and EH cleanup, record writeback and throwing Block-copy rollback",
    "Native subscript AST import and source/PCH diagnostics, printing and codegen; genuine internal/surrounding unsequenced conflicts remain diagnosed",
    "Published inline key-path bodies use written dependency traversal and location-independent public operation/literal fingerprints; generated private helpers remain compiler-owned",
    "Pinned metadata header projection and eager preloading before native merge unify opaque descriptors with subsequent SDK definitions; required subscript/typed capabilities enforce consumer admission",
    "Clangd written operand hover, rename, references and highlighting; semantic accessors do not create public operator tokens",
    "System 2.14 large captured callable arrays preserve unrepresented initializer effects and conservative wildcard invocation summaries, including the 63/64 boundary and 128-element nested/copied captures"
  ],
